    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "FOR SALE BY ONLINE AUCTION – THURSDAY 29TH OCTOBER 2026 AT 12.00 NOON\r\n\r\nREMOTE BIDDING ONLY.  You must pre-register to bid on our website www.dpa.ie and follow the Offr tab. \r\n\r\nRegistration closes on Wednesday 28TH OCTOBER 2026 AT 5PM\r\n \r\nDillon Prendiville Auctioneers are delighted to present 45 Bridge Road to the market. This beautifully appointed, mid-terrace, two-storey residence combines the convenience of town-centre living with bright, well-proportioned accommodation. Ideally located, the property is just a short, easy stroll from Listowel Town Square, the Town Park, the local leisure centre, and the scenic Greenway.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n•\tInviting Layout: Features a compact streetside front yard leading to an entrance porch, hallway, bright living/dining room, kitchen, 3 comfortable bedrooms, and 2 shower rooms.\r\n•\tExcellent Access: Benefits from a pedestrian right-of-way under a shared archway, offering seamless access to the property.\r\n•\tRear Yard & Storage: Includes a small, low-maintenance rear yard with pedestrian access and a practical lean-to lock-up store.\r\n•\tReady to Go: Fully connected to all mains services, including water, sewer, and electricity.\r\n•\tSuperb Location: Enjoy effortless access to all of Listowel’s premium amenities right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nThis property represents a fantastic opportunity for first-time buyers, investors, or those looking to downsize. Viewing is highly advised to truly appreciate everything this home has to offer.\r\n\r\nTo Arrange a Viewing: Contact Dillon Prendiville Auctioneers 068-21739 today."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch - 1.4m x 1.9m \r\nFitted carpet and two windows overlooking Bridge Road.\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway - 1.6m x 3.1m \r\nFitted carpet and storage underneath stairs. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 2.9m x 3.1m \r\nFitted carpet - ground floor overlooking Bridge Road.\r\n\r\nLiving/Dining Room - 3.3m x 5.0m \r\nFitted carpet - dual aspect.\r\n\r\nKitchen - 2.4m x 2.9m \r\nWith fitted units, stainless steel sink, plumbed for washing machine, electric oven door to rear courtyard.  Kitchen and downstairs wet-room has a lean-to felt roof.\r\n\r\nDownstairs Wet Room - 2.2m x 1.6m \r\nFully tiled floor to ceiling, wc, whb, Triton t90z shower with handrails and frosted window. \r\n\r\nLanding - 0.8m x 2.4m \r\nFitted carpet and attic access.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom - 2.4m x 2.5m \r\nVinyl flooring, wc, whb, bath, shower and frosted window.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 1.9m x 3.3m \r\nFitted carpet, recessed built-in hot-press and storage -  window over looking rear courtyard.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.1m x 4.9m \r\nFitted carpet - overlooking Bridge Road.\r\n\r\nShed - 2.0m x 1.5m \r\nShed with side pedestrian right of way access to private lane way.  \r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Modern double glazed PVC windows and 1 aluminium window in the kitchen.\r\nElectric storage heating. \r\nLocated close to Listowel Town Square, the Town Park, the local leisure centre and the scenic Greenway.\r\nAll mains services and electricity connected.\r\nMasonry construction.\r\nGrants available.\r\nContents included in the sale."
      },
